      ":question/id": "8debca67-4d39-5b8d-b259-7d21a6263a8b",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\sin(x-315^\\circ)$ using $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$.\n\n$\\sin(x-315^\\circ)=$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the difference formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u-v)=\\sin u\\cos v-\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nApply it and substitute the exact special-angle values:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x-315^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 315^\\circ-\\cos x\\sin 315^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)-\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\sin x+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
