      ":question/id": "c40e4c19-da38-57f3-9798-0da3635ad49b",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\sin(x-300^\\circ)$ using $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$.\n\n$\\sin(x-300^\\circ)=$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the difference formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u-v)=\\sin u\\cos v-\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nApply it and substitute the exact special-angle values:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x-300^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 300^\\circ-\\cos x\\sin 300^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)-\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{2}\\sin x+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
