      ":question/id": "d3ac2633-0364-510a-8cba-1528dd75f801",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\sin(x+315^\\circ)$ using $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$. Enter exact coefficients, including their signs.\n\n$\\sin(x+315^\\circ)=$ {{field-1}} $\\sin x-$ {{field-2}} $\\cos x$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the sum formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u+v)=\\sin u\\cos v+\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nApply it and substitute the exact special-angle values:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x+315^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 315^\\circ+\\cos x\\sin 315^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)+\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\sin x-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThe minus sign outside the second blank is supplied. The entries are $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ and $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$, respectively."
    },
