      ":question/id": "40160f30-76ff-5ae7-b67f-9d1bec8d54c7",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\sin(x-180^\\circ)$ using $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$.\n\n$\\sin(x-180^\\circ)=$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the difference formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u-v)=\\sin u\\cos v-\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nApply it and substitute the exact special-angle values:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x-180^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 180^\\circ-\\cos x\\sin 180^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)-\\cos x\\cdot\\left(0\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\sin x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
