      ":question/id": "a26c3cda-105b-5298-9e29-d958cb384e3f",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\sin(x-270^\\circ)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ or $\\cos x$.\n\n$\\sin(x-270^\\circ)=$ {{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the difference formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u-v)=\\sin u\\cos v-\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nApply it and substitute the exact special-angle values:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x-270^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 270^\\circ-\\cos x\\sin 270^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(0\\right)-\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)\\\\\n&=\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
    },
    {
      ":db/id": 17592186705309,
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
